    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's just a temporary distraction, isn't it? like if you look at the math of it, the universe is expanding and eventually everything decays. if there's no objective meaning, then staying alive or not staying alive are basically just two different variables with the same value. it's all just neutral at the end of the day.",
